{{Term/Store|Water Buffalo|Water Buffalo|Series, BotW, TotK|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite|'''Water Buffalo'''|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|'''Water Buffalo'''|Hyrule Compendium|TotK}}</ref>

==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Water Buffalo}}
Water Buffalo are a type of [[Creature]] that can be found near sources of [[Water (Terrain)|Water]], where they are known to graze on [[Grass]].<ref name="Compendium">{{Cite|These wild cows come equipped with big, strong horns. They live off grass that grows near the waterfront. Their meat is considered to be high quality, so they're a common target among hunters. Fun fact: the domesticated Hateno cow, often raised in villages, was bred through selective breeding using these. |Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref> When approached from the front, they will charge at [[Link]]. When killed, they can drop [[Raw Meat]] or [[Raw Gourmet Meat]]. While Water Buffalo are wild [[Animal]]s, some have been domesticated into [[Hateno Cow]]s.<ref name="Compendium"/>

